{{!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     navbar — the site bar. Ported from NS-Design-System/templates/navbar.html.
     ------------------------------------------------------------------------
     COMPOSITION ONLY. Every piece is its own partial in partials/navbar/, so
     this file says what the bar is made of and nothing about how any of it
     looks. If you are here to change a control, it is in its own file.

     The items come from Ghost's {{navigation}} HELPER, not from a foreach —
     see the warning at the top of partials/navigation.hbs for why iterating
     `navigation` anywhere else renders nothing at all. `variant` is ours: the
     helper merges its hash into the context, so one helper and one partial
     serve the bar, the sheet, the footer and the structured data.

     The "-Label" dropdown convention is documented in navbar/links.hbs.
     ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ --}}
<nav class="ns-topnav ns-topnav--center" aria-label="{{t "Main"}}">
    {{> "navbar/brand"}}
    {{navigation variant="bar"}}
    {{> "navbar/actions"}}
</nav>
